  "worked_solution": "To subtract $3$ from $1$, we start at $1$ on the number line and move $3$ places to the left. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14132866/assets/95e2cd27b39bb0191478c49d23b6f77ba71bf4585cc94429aaf00adc3897534b.png)\n\nThis gives $1-3=-2.$",
